{"id":"38760d0fb2c20b34","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-mm-unification-run.md","title":"有限运行与累积答案","display":"df-mm-unification-run — 有限运行与累积答案","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-mm-unification-run","aliases":["56-df-mm-unification-run"],"display":"df-mm-unification-run — 有限运行与累积答案","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-step]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Definition 7.7.1 and following discussion","source_printed_pages":"290","source_ocr_blocks":[311],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-mm-unification-run"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-mm-unification-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mm-unification-run — 有限运行与累积答案"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Definition 7.7.1 and following discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"290"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>311</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n\\)</span>。带标签步骤见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a>；后缀组合及恒等替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff E_0\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff E_0\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_0\\coloneqq\\iota,\\qquad a_{i+1}\\coloneqq a_i\\circ\\delta_i\\quad(0\\le i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_0\\coloneqq\\iota,\\qquad a_{i+1}\\coloneqq a_i\\circ\\delta_i\\quad(0\\le i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\coloneqq a_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\coloneqq a_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E_n\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E_n\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Failed}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Failed}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空标签列的答案是恒等替换。累积顺序为先前得到的替换再接新标签，符合全目录后缀组合接口。有限递归在0,…,n上给出唯一a_i；不预先假定运行成功或假定算法终止。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mm-unification-step","status":"resolved","id":"6ab7b6083e677200","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-mm-unification-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mm-unification-step","status":"resolved","id":"6ab7b6083e677200","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n$。带标签步骤见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]；后缀组合及恒等替换 $\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n$。带标签步骤见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]；后缀组合及恒等替换 $\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff E_0\\in\\mathcal G\\land\\forall i<n\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"a_0\\coloneqq\\iota,\\qquad a_{i+1}\\coloneqq a_i\\circ\\delta_i\\quad(0\\le i<n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\coloneqq a_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E_n\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Failed}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\land E_n=\\bot.","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"12f957d86ed7612e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,G,H$ 为互异函数符号，元数分别为2、1、2；$x,y,z,u\\in\\mathcal V$ 两两不同。签名包含这些符号。合一步骤、后缀答案及MGU见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]、[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]、[[56-thm-mm-unification-correctness]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-mm-unification-run.md]]"},{"id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n$，且 $\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)$。$S=\\operato